          "Mary Help of Christians was the name under which he placed the whole project. The basilica at Valdocco was consecrated on June 9, 1868, and he attributed the buildings, the debts paid, and the boys preserved to her intercession. That is his testimony and the Salesian family's devotion. Catholics may share it by praying the Memorare or a Hail Mary for a young person, in the spirit of the [[/blog/virgin-mary-complete-guide/|guide to Mary]] and the [[/blog/the-memorare-prayer/|Memorare]]. He still built workshops and stayed with the boys. The [[/blog/catholic-homeschooling-guide/|homeschooling guide]] and the [[/blog/catholic-parenting-raising-children-in-faith/|parenting guide]] translate the method at home.",
